{"id":"b05776a499b0b211","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_AnyRawRow.md","title":"AnyRawRow","display":"AnyRawRow","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"AnyRawRow","parameters":["z811","z812","z813"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"AnyRawRow"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>z811</span><span>z812</span><span>z813</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：指标替换与规约。有序参数：<code>z811</code>、<code>z812</code>、<code>z813</code>。</p>\n<p>指标转换的有限原始项；注解是惰性集合载荷。：单行局部条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ AnyRawRow z811 z812 z813)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists t\n  (and\n    (= z813 t)\n    (or\n      (exists z816 (and (@ Nat z816) (@ TVar z816 t)))\n      (or\n        (exists z817 (@ TConst z817 t))\n        (or\n          (exists z819\n            (and\n              (@ ULam z819 t)\n              (exists z822 (exists z823 (and (in z822 z812) (and (@ App z811 z822 z823) (= z823 z819)))))))\n          (or\n            (exists z818\n              (exists z819\n                (and\n                  (@ TLam z818 z819 t)\n                  (exists z824 (exists z825 (and (in z824 z812) (and (@ App z811 z824 z825) (= z825 z819))))))))\n            (exists z820\n              (exists z821\n                (and\n                  (@ TApp z820 z821 t)\n                  (and\n                    (exists z826 (exists z827 (and (in z826 z812) (and (@ App z811 z826 z827) (= z827 z820)))))\n                    (exists z828 (exists z829 (and (in z828 z812) (and (@ App z811 z828 z829) (= z829 z821)))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e2136a636857d477\" href=\"?note=e2136a636857d477\" title=\"ZFC_Nat\">Nat</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8ee8586c4703b19e\" href=\"?note=8ee8586c4703b19e\" title=\"ZFC_TApp\">TApp</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ce774aac70609584\" href=\"?note=ce774aac70609584\" title=\"ZFC_TConst\">TConst</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"59c4a3ef7b6eaded\" href=\"?note=59c4a3ef7b6eaded\" title=\"ZFC_TLam\">TLam</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"00213bb93d499434\" href=\"?note=00213bb93d499434\" title=\"ZFC_TVar\">TVar</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f077e9016ad9f66b\" href=\"?note=f077e9016ad9f66b\" title=\"ZFC_ULam\">ULam</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ AnyRawRow z811 z812 z813)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_TApp|TApp]]；[[ZFC_TConst|TConst]]；[[ZFC_TLam|TLam]]；[[ZFC_TVar|TVar]]；[[ZFC_ULam|ULam]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Nat","status":"resolved","id":"e2136a636857d477